  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00089",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“嘿，我去参拜了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hey, I went to pray at the shrine.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00089",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "还是和昨天一样。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was still the same as yesterday.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00089",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "真奇怪啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "How strange.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00089",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "这回虽没说是怪兽，却说是灾星（附体邪魔）呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This time they did not call it a monster, but they said it was an evil star, a possessing spirit.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00089",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "还说不是不懂道理的家伙，不那么闹腾也会走的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "They also said it was not something beyond reason, and that it would leave even without making such a fuss.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00089",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "再怎么说，还是衰老病。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After all, it is still a disease of old age.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00089",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "虽然不会发生突变，但身体还是会渐渐地衰弱下去。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There will be no sudden change, but the body will gradually keep growing weaker.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
